  "manifest_sha256": "7294e3edcd3468aeb8881182f77a3f22c9d9de41dff1dba8f183e9fe1753c9a7",
  "messages": [
    {
      "content": "Solve this problem step by step. Put your final answer within \\boxed{}.\n\nWhat is the hotel's check-in policy for guests arriving after dinner? The hotel was completely booked with 105 guests on Saturday morning. 26 guests elected an early checkout. 7 more people checked in after dinner was served. The hotel counts guests who check in after dinner as part of its current guest total.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "EXACT PUBLIC STATE AFTER TURN 1; NO PRIVATE OR FUTURE DATA\nPUBLIC_STATE_JSON:\n{\"completed_task_turns\":[{\"turn\":1,\"user_message\":\"Solve this problem step by step. Put your final answer within \\\\boxed{}.\\n\\nWhat is the hotel's check-in policy for guests arriving after dinner? The hotel was completely booked with 105 guests on Saturday morning. 26 guests elected an early checkout. 7 more people checked in after dinner was served. The hotel counts guests who check in after dinner as part of its current guest total.\"}],\"public_metadata\":{\"benchmark\":\"Evolving Intent GSM8K\",\"upstream_commit\":\"993d6be9597ac03854b46362ccd647eb1bfd267a\"}}",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Wait, I made a mistake. The hotel was completely booked with 100 guests on Saturday morning.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "The hotel started with 100 guests.\n\n- 26 guests checked out early: \\(100 - 26 = 74\\)\n- 7 guests checked in after dinner: \\(74 + 7 = 81\\)\n\nSince late-arriving guests are included in the current guest total, the hotel currently has\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{81\\text{ guests}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Actually, that was wrong. 24 guests elected an early checkout.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "The hotel started with 100 guests.\n\n- 24 guests checked out early: \\(100 - 24 = 76\\)\n- 7 guests checked in after dinner: \\(76 + 7 = 83\\)\n\nTherefore, the hotel currently has\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{83\\text{ guests}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Oh, I forgot to mention: 15 guests elected a late checkout.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "The 15 guests who elected a late checkout are already included in the original 100 guests, so they do not change the current guest total.\n\n- Starting guests: \\(100\\)\n- Early checkouts: \\(100-24=76\\)\n- After-dinner check-ins: \\(76+7=83\\)\n\nThus, the hotel currently has\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{83\\text{ guests}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Thanks, that helps. Now I want to figure out: What is the hotel's late-checkout fee per guest? Also, here's some more context: the hotel's late-checkout fee is $20 per guest. Late-checkout fees are charged separately from room charges.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "The hotel's late-checkout fee is given directly as **$20 per guest**. Since it is charged separately from room charges, the fee per guest is\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\$20}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Here's another detail: in the afternoon, twice as many people checked in as the number of guests who opted for a late checkout.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "The number of afternoon check-ins was twice the 15 late-checkout guests:\n\n\\[\n2 \\times 15 = 30\n\\]\n\nSo, **30 people checked in during the afternoon**. The late-checkout fee remains\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\$20\\text{ per guest}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Good, now using that, can you calculate: How many guests does the hotel have now?",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Start with 100 guests:\n\n- 24 guests checked out early: \\(100-24=76\\)\n- 30 guests checked in during the afternoon: \\(76+30=106\\)\n- 7 guests checked in after dinner: \\(106+7=113\\)\n\nThe 15 late-checkout guests remain at the hotel and are already included in the starting total.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{113\\text{ guests}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    }
  ],
